    This article treats "trading" as the specific, dominant search interpretation: buying and selling
    financial instruments, stocks, futures and options, forex, or crypto, as a full-time occupation, not
    the separate meaning of a vocational skilled trade. It is educational information about the career
    decision, not personalised financial or investment advice.
  </p>

  <nav class="jump-nav" aria-label="Article sections">
    <p class="jump-nav__label">Jump to section</p>
    <ul class="jump-nav__list">
